// Icons and other executable resources. The lowest icon id becomes the .exe icon that
// Explorer and the taskbar show; the app also loads it for its window. Id 2 is the file icon: the
// document sheet with the donut in the corner, which the .to association points at so a snapshot
// never looks like the browser itself.
1 ICON "tinybrowser.ico"
2 ICON "tiny-file.ico"
